; A build profile that links the interpreter statically.
;
; Used by the Dockerfile so the binary lifted out of the image depends on no
; loader at all, and therefore runs on any Linux rather than only where the
; image's own libc is present. A dynamically linked musl binary fails with
; "required file not found" on a glibc host, which is what this avoids.
(env
 (static
  (link_flags (-ccopt -static))))
